{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "JHN",
  "chapter": 14,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let not your heart be troubled: ye believe in God, believe also in me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In my Father's house are many mansions: if ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "so",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", I would have told you. I go to prepare a place for you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And if I go and prepare a place for you, I will come again and receive you to myself; that where I am, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " ye may be also.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And whither I go ye know, and the way ye know.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thomas saith to him, Lord, we know not whither thou goest; and how can we know the way?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus saith to him, I am the way, and the truth, and the life: no man cometh to the Father, but by me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If ye had known me, ye would have known my Father also: and from henceforth ye know him, and have seen him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Philip saith to him, Lord, show us the Father, and it sufficeth us.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus saith to him, Have I been so long time with you, and yet hast thou not known me Philip? he that hath seen me, hath seen the Father; and how sayest thou ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "then",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", Show us the Father?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Believest thou not that I am in the Father, and the Father in me? the words that I speak to you, I speak not from myself: but the Father that dwelleth in me, he doeth the works.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Believe me that I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the Father, and the Father in me: or else believe me for the very works' sake.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Verily, verily, I say to you, he that believeth on me, the works that I do shall he do also; and greater ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "works",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " than these shall he do; because I go to my Father.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And whatever ye shall ask in my name, that will I do, that the Father may be glorified in the Son.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If ye shall ask any thing in my name, I will do ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If ye love me, keep my commandments.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And I will pray the Father, and he will give you another Comforter, that he may abide with you for ever;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the Spirit of truth; whom the world cannot receive, because it seeth him not, neither knoweth him: but ye know him; for he dwelleth with you, and will be in you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will not leave you comfortless; I will come to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yet a little while, and the world seeth me no more; but ye see me: because I live, ye shall live also.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "At that day ye shall know that I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in my Father, and ye in me, and I in you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that hath my commandments, and keepeth them, he it is that loveth me: and he that loveth me, shall be loved by my Father, and I will love him, and will manifest myself to him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Judas, not Iscariot, saith to him, Lord, how is it that thou wilt manifest thyself to us, and not to the world?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus answered and said to him, If a man loveth me, he will keep my words: and my Father will love him, and we will come to him, and make our abode with him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that loveth me not, keepeth not my sayings: and the word which ye hear is not mine, but that of the Father who sent me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These things have I spoken to you, being ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "yet",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " present with you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But the Comforter, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "who is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the Holy Spirit, whom the Father will send in my name, he will teach you all things, and bring all things to your remembrance, whatever I have said to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Peace I leave with you, my peace I give to you: not as the world giveth, give I to you. Let not your heart be troubled, neither let it be afraid.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ye have heard that I said to you, I go away, and come ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "again",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to you. If ye loved me, ye would rejoice, because I said, I go to the Father: for my Father is greater than I.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And now I have told you before it cometh to pass, that when it hath come to pass, ye may believe.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hereafter I will not talk much with you: for the prince of this world cometh, and hath nothing in me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.14.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.14.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But that the world may know that I love the Father; and as the Father gave me commandment, even so I do. Arise, let us go hence.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
